        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Paper, newsprint, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Paper, newsprint, at regional storage
na;
UUID: 39130cc9-8efe-3cce-9dc2-f756432dd2fb
This module includes the transport from the production site to a central distribution site  within Switzerland for the domestic and the foreign newsprint paper consumed in Switzerland.; Geography: Deliveries within Europe according to CEPI statistics. 
Location:  Deliveries within Europe according to CEPI statistics. 
Technology: Average situation
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Total Swiss consumption 2000: 332.7 kt (official statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Standard distances for domestic production, individual imports from the different CEPI countries. Estimated distribution of DIP-containing and 0%-DIP newsprint based on country-specific production information.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_39130cc9-8efe-3cce-9dc2-f756432dd2fb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
